#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:5
#: 3f35c085a7af4830b223ef05713bd8cf
msgid "Requesting Data From The Autopilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:7
#: 30cde6affc9a4883abf94f8ea967c40b
msgid "The ground station or companion computer can request the data it wants (and the rate) using one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:9
#: 6652ce1d4cb54e2d924e0162ece84032
msgid "Set the ``SRx_`` parameters to cause the autopilot to pro-actively send groups of messages on start-up.  This method is easy to set-up for a small number of drones but is not recommended for most applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:10
#: b5b2c19d8b574f3cb213a5be1851cfa5
msgid "Send `REQUEST_DATA_STREAM <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ messages to set the rate for groups of messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:11
#: 6739cf5da5144e81a4712d7b6f4eff44
msgid "Send a `SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__ command (within a `COMMAND_LONG <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ message) to precisely control the rate of an individual message.  Note this is only supported on ArduPilot 4.0 and higher"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:12
#: 07e9318aae7f4277b1b8a45d05e157a7
msgid "Send a `REQUEST_MESSAGE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE>`__ command (within a `COMMAND_LONG <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ message) to request a single instance of a message.  Note this is only supported on ArduPilot 4.0 and higher"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:13
#: 4952ecd157b74aed9e826901de7d9e8d
msgid "Create configuration files stored on the SD card or in ROMFS specifying message stream rates on a per-channel basis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:14
#: 5fe81995d4ac4379aa1bd0bb6beaf611
msgid "Install a Lua script to set individual messages rates (e.g. Set Message Interval via a Lua script).  See \"Using a LUA Script\" section below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:16
#: 7dac30b65d1c4b9e841510054178ee93
msgid "Note that the stream rates will temporarily be 4 or more times slower than requested while parameters and waypoints are being sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:18
#: a499c3d438284cbe808354e7fc94aa9c
msgid "More details on the above methods can be found below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:22
#: fb6ee9d38eca4724a7efffc037d5eaa9
msgid "If you find your message rates are reverting to some fixed value after you set them, see the \"Rates Reverting to some Fixed value\" section at the bottom of this page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:25
#: ddfc7f8010bd49c78806db77b6027d4d
msgid "Using SRx Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:27
#: 2bf659cb36044194ad9cb47297f10946
msgid "Setting the ``SRx_`` parameters (and then rebooting the autopilot) will cause the autopilot to pro-actively send groups of messages to the ground station.  This is not the recommended method because the ground station has no way to determine what \"x\" should be."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:29
#: d0232385350f4dca8a96668a71ac4c03
msgid "Connect to the autopilot with a ground station"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:30
#: 776938e93537465e8baf3159004dc4b7
msgid "Determine which telemetry connection is being used.  For example if the ground station is connected to the autopilot's \"Telem1\" port (perhaps using a wifi or telemetry radio) then the ``SR1_`` parameters should be modified"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:31
#: 5956da5cd33a4aff98fdd2898b2ac458
